QT_MS_BROWSER_STEPS=1. Your browser was opened on the Microsoft sign-in page.\n2. Sign in. You will land on a blank page.\n3. Copy that page's full address IMMEDIATELY (the code disappears from it a moment later) and paste it below, or paste just the code=... value.
QT_MS_OPEN_BROWSER_AGAIN=Open the browser again
QT_MS_CONTINUE=Continue
QT_MS_BROWSER_WARNING=The browser way can be flaky: Microsoft sometimes strips the code before you can copy it. If that happens, try again or use the embedded sign-in.
QT_MS_USE_BROWSER=Use the browser instead
QT_MS_USE_EMBEDDED=Use the embedded sign-in instead
QT_MS_NO_WEBENGINE=The embedded browser (Qt WebEngine) is not installed, so the browser sign-in is used instead.
QT_MS_LOGIN_LOAD_FAIL=The sign-in page could not be loaded. Check your connection or use the browser instead.
QT_MS_NO_CODE=Could not find a code=... value in the pasted text.
