QT_SOURCE_PACKAGE=Build-from-source package
QT_SOURCE_PACKAGE_DESC=There's an oranglauncher AUR package that builds the launcher with Nuitka on your machine instead of shipping a prebuilt binary. Prefer compiling yourself? Install that one. Want the quick prebuilt? Keep oranglauncher-bin.
