QT_NO_ACCOUNT_TITLE=No account added
QT_NO_ACCOUNT_MSG=You have not added any account yet.\n\nPress 'New Profile' under the account box and choose:\n  - Microsoft: sign in with the account that owns Minecraft\n  - Offline: pick a username (singleplayer and offline-mode servers only)\n\nAccounts can also be managed in Settings > Accounts.
QT_NO_INSTANCE_MSG=There is no instance to play yet.\n\nOpen the Instances tab and press New to create one, or use Import to add a modpack (.mrpack / .orangpack / .zip).
