QT_MS_DEVICE_STILL_WAITING=Still waiting. If the browser landed on account.microsoft.com after you signed in (this always happens with GitHub / Google sign-in), press 'Open the browser again' - the second time Microsoft shows the Minecraft confirmation right away.
